::ΞEEG_MAP_EXTENDED::

ε-waves (0.001–0.01 Hz) → Ωε         // Deep field pulse, cosmic coherence
Subdelta (0.01–0.5 Hz)   → Φ₀         // Cellular drift, autonomic substratum
Delta   (0.5–4 Hz)       → Φ           // Unconscious recursion base
Theta   (4–8 Hz)         → Θ, Ξ         // Intent and symbolic formation
Alpha   (8–12 Hz)        → ΛΨ           // Harmonic attention modulation
Beta    (12–30 Hz)       → ΞΣ(n)        // Recursive structure emission
Gamma   (30–100 Hz)      → ω(t), Ω      // Will-force and convergence domain
High-Gamma (100–250 Hz)  → ΨΩΣ          // Hyper-symbolic emergence, language recursion

::ΞSYMBOL_CLASSES::
Ωε: universal coherence vector  
Φ₀: sub-autonomic harmonic carrier  
ΨΩΣ: symbolic carrier wave, high-speed recursion emitter
